   "end": 148.333,
   "text": "The honest detector compares whole histograms. [pause 0.4] Thirty-nine targets, and chance predicts thirty-nine. [pause 0.4] The chi-squared misfit squares each bar's gap and divides by chance's bar, because short bars wobble less: a miss on a short bar counts more. Map A scores [pause 0.2] two point oh. [pause 0.6] Three out of four simulated chance maps score worse. That share, p, is point seven four. [pause 0.7]",
